WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.132 --> 00:00:11.664
Hello! My name is Omar.

2
00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:20.125
And this is my very special barn.

3
00:00:20.126 --> 00:00:23.033
You'll learn its secret

4
00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:29.366
soon. But first let's meet Polly and

5
00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:53.880
Jack. They live on the

6
00:00:53.881 --> 00:00:58.268
farm. Minnie: Ahh. Everyone ate

7
00:00:58.269 --> 00:01:06.701
