22
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:38.924
Minnie: Jack! You knocked over the hens' eggs.

23
00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.130
Jack:

24
00:02:41.131 --> 00:02:45.244
Sorry. Minnie: That's it! You two need

25
