26
00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:52.657
Polly: Yuck!

27
00:02:52.658 --> 00:02:55.532
Jack: That's a lot of work!

28
00:02:55.533 --> 00:02:57.593
Minnie: Yes, it is.

29
00:02:57.594 --> 00:03:07.203
First you both can clean it. Now go.

30
00:03:07.204 --> 00:03:20.923
Gary: And don't hurry back! Honk!

